et="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-07d8c001>米其林.500盤名店食安隱憂　業者：下架.換供貨商</a></li><li class="news-breaking-bar-item" data-v-07d8c001><a href="https://news.cts.com.tw/cts/general/202610/202610193091513.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-07d8c001>國軍演習戰車輾碎「貓眼石」　竹市府承諾將優先修繕</a></li><li class="news-breaking-bar-item" data-v-07d8c001><a href="https://news.cts.com.tw/cna/politics/202610/202610193091524.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-07d8c001>法國暴力示威　外交部：避免前往抗議地點、提高警覺</a></li><li class="news-breaking-bar-item" data-v-07d8c001><a href="https://news.cts.com.tw/cts/general/202610/202610193091532.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-07d8c001>「烏龍院」商標遭廢止！敖幼祥怒　智慧局：可提救濟</a></li><!--]--></ul></div></div></section><main data-v-dcb16d82><!--[--><div class="news-scaffold" data-v-a339c0c3><div class="news-scaffold-grid" data-v-a339c0c3><div class="news-scaffold-main" data-v-a339c0c3><!--[--><nav aria-label="麵包屑" data-v-a34bb7d6><ol class="news-breadcrumb" role="list" data-v-a34bb7d6><!--[--><li class="news-breadcrumb-item" data-v-a34bb7d6><a href="/" class="news-breadcrumb-link" data-v-a34bb7d6>首頁</a></li><li class="news-breadcrumb-item" aria-current="page" data-v-a34bb7d6><a href="/local/list" class="news-breadcrumb-link" data-v-a34bb7d6>地方</a></li><!--]--></ol></nav><article class="news-detail-body font-medium" data-v-592a5968><div class="ad-item ad-full-overlay ad-2025_newssinglenews_overlay" aria-label="廣告" data-v-592a5968><div id="div-gpt-ad-1760603645543-0"></div></div><h1 class="news-detail-title" data-v-592a5968>【台語新聞】基隆綠營美女刺客拚議員　推朱書昕.吳巧瀅成嬌點</h1><div class="news-detail-meta" data-v-592a5968><div class="news-detail-meta-info" data-v-592a5968><time datetime="2026-01-19 16:26:00" data-v-592a5968>2026-01-19 16:26:00</time> / 綜合報導 / 基隆市</div><div class="news-detail-meta-actions" data-v-592a5968><div class="news-detail-meta-tool" role="group" aria-label="分享" data-v-592a5968><span class="news-detail-meta-label" data-v-592a5968>分享：</span><span data-v-592a5968></span></div><div class="news-detail-meta-tool" role="group" aria-label="字級" data-v-592a5968><span class="news-detail-meta-label" data-v-592a5968>字級：</span><ul class="news-detail-meta-icons" role="list" data-v-592a5968><!--[--><li data-v-592a5968><button type="button" aria-label="大字" aria-pressed="false" data-v-592a5968><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;%20width=&#39;36&#39;%20height=&#39;36&#39;%20viewBox=&#39;0%200%2036%2036&#39;%3e%3cg%20id=&#39;字級_B&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(-0.348)&#39;%3e%3cg%20id=&#39;logo&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(0.348)&#39;%3e%3ccircle%20id=&#39;circle&#39;%20cx=&#39;18&#39;%20cy=&#39;18&#39;%20r=&#39;18&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(0)&#39;%20fill=&#39;%23dedede&#39;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cpath%20id=&#39;icon_字級&#39;%20d=&#39;M9.95,34.328,17.058,15.37h3.417l7.108,18.958H24.318l-1.709-4.833H14.935l-1.709,4.833H9.96Zm5.976-7.583h5.692l-2.75-7.866h-.192Z&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(-0.541%20-6.685)&#39;%20fill=&#39;%23696969&#39;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt width="36" height="36" data-v-592a5968></button></li><li data-v-592a5968><button type="button" aria-label="中字" aria-pressed="true" data-v-592a5968><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;%20width=&#39;36&#39;%20height=&#39;36&#39;%20viewBox=&#39;0%200%2036%2036&#39;%3e%3cg%20id=&#39;字級_M&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(0.078)&#39;%3e%3cg%20id=&#39;logo&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(-0.077)&#39;%3e%3ccircle%20id=&#39;circle&#39;%20cx=&#39;18&#39;%20cy=&#39;18&#39;%20r=&#39;18&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(0)&#39;%20fill=&#39;%23dedede&#39;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cpath%20id=&#39;icon_字級&#39;%20d=&#39;M9.95,29.59l5.331-14.22h2.563l5.331,14.22h-2.45l-1.282-3.625H13.689L12.407,29.59H9.958ZM14.432,23.9H18.7L16.639,18h-.144Z&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(1.63%20-4.514)&#39;%20fill=&#39;%23696969&#39;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt width="36" height="36" data-v-592a5968></button></li><li data-v-592a5968><button type="button" aria-label="小字" aria-pressed="false" data-v-592a5968><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;%20width=&#39;36&#39;%20height=&#39;36&#39;%20viewBox=&#39;0%200%2036%2036&#39;%3e%3cg%20id=&#39;字級_S&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(-0.5)&#39;%3e%3cg%20id=&#39;logo&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(0.499)&#39;%3e%3ccircle%20id=&#39;circle&#39;%20cx=&#39;18&#39;%20cy=&#39;18&#39;%20r=&#39;18&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(0)&#39;%20fill=&#39;%23dedede&#39;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cpath%20id=&#39;icon_字級&#39;%20d=&#39;M9.95,24.618l3.468-9.248h1.667l3.468,9.248H16.959l-.834-2.358H12.382l-.834,2.358H9.955Zm2.915-3.7h2.777L14.3,17.082h-.094Z&#39;%20transform=&#39;translate(3.801%20-1.619)&#39;%20fill=&#39;%23696969&#39;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt width="36" height="36" data-v-592a5968></button></li><!--]--></ul></div></div></div><div class="news-detail-video" data-v-592a5968><iframe class="news-detail-video-frame" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/OICSXhJCZGA?rel=0" title="【台語新聞】基隆綠營美女刺客拚議員　推朱書昕.吳巧瀅成嬌點" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen loading="lazy" data-v-592a5968></iframe></div><div class="article-content" data-v-592a5968><p></p><p>基隆市議員選舉中山區被地方戲稱史上超難選，因為雖然有四席，但不只老將想連任，就連新秀也積極表態參選，目前初步就呈現九搶四的局面。另外，暖暖區也競爭激烈，三位現任議員都有意願拚連任，民進黨在七堵和中正區，這次再推出兩位美女新人，分別在中山區、暖暖區，希望能再開出紅盤。</p><p></p><p>車水馬龍的十字路口，粉粉的看板高高掛起，繽紛色彩成功吸引目光，年底的九合一大選，新人搶曝光更要早一步準備。外型亮眼親切有禮的吳巧瀅，從小和爸爸相依為命，小時候曾經是家扶中心的扶助兒，半工半讀完成學業，開早餐店每年都辦義賣捐贈回饋家扶中心，參選爆發力讓外界不敢小覷。</p>基隆市中山區議員參選人(民)吳巧瀅說：「一路走來，看過太多弱勢家庭，婦女與孩子需要幫助，卻常常找不到資源和管道。」基隆市中山區，去年底設籍人口，大約4萬5千5百多人，四席議員席次，現任的民進黨施偉政，國民黨宋瑋莉郭美秀，三人拚連任，謝國樑的前中山區秘書林祐德，還有同黨的前議員莊敬聖，也都爭取黨內提名，民進黨則派出美女刺客吳巧瀅，另外暖暖區有三席議員，現任的連恩典林旻勳陳冠羽，都有意願拚連任，民進黨同步派朱書昕擔任美女刺客。<p></p><p>基隆市暖暖區議員參選人(民)朱書昕說：「透過參選，成為暖暖區第一位女性市議員，用更細膩更全面更貼近家庭與日常的觀點，提出讓暖暖鄉親真正有感也值得期待的政策方向。」</p><p>先生是民進黨基隆市黨部主委林明智，朱書昕在社群媒體暱稱費歐娜擁有許多鐵粉，現在是暖暖當地志工協會理事長，希望透過藝文經歷為地方創生努力，基隆市議員競爭激烈，綠營的嬌點牌就看能不能再開出紅盤。</p><p></p></div><!----><ul class="news-detail-tags" role="list" data-v-592a5968><!--[--><li data-v-592a5968><a href="/search?keyword=%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89" class data-v-592a5968>選舉</a></li><li data-v-592a5968><a href="/search?keyword=%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1" class data-v-592a5968>議員</a></li><li data-v-592a5968><a href="/search?keyword=%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82" class data-v-592a5968>基隆市</a></li><li data-v-592a5968><a href="/search?keyword=%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E5%8D%80" class data-v-592a5968>中山區</a></li><!--]--></ul><nav class="news-detail-nav" aria-label="文章導航" data-v-592a5968><a href="/cts/local/202601/202601192554291.html" class="news-detail-nav-prev" data-v-592a5968><span class="iconify i-uil:arrow-left news-detail-nav-icon" aria-hidden="true" style data-v-592a5968></span><span data-v-592a5968>地方</span> 上一篇 </a><a href="/cts/local/202601/202601192554289.html" class="news-detail-nav-next" data-v-592a5968><span data-v-592a5968>地方</span> 下一篇 <span class="iconify i-uil:arrow-right news-detail-nav-icon" aria-hidden="true" style data-v-592a5968></span></a></nav></article><div class="ad-item ad-full-parallex ad-2025_newssinglenews_footerscroll_320x480" aria-label="廣告"><div id="div-gpt-ad-1760602380309-0"></div></div><section class="news-extended" data-v-f68d5a33><h2 class="news-extended-heading" data-v-f68d5a33>延伸閱讀</h2><ol class="news-extended-list" role="list" data-v-f68d5a33><!--[--><!--[--><li class="news-extended-item" data-v-f68d5a33><a href="/cts/general/202512/202512252547277.html" class="news-extended-link" data-v-f68d5a33><span class="news-extended-title" data-v-f68d5a33>許甫參選稀釋泛藍選票？　李明璇：是「隊友」不是「對手」</span><time class="news-extended-date" datetime="2025/12/25" data-v-f68d5a33>2025/12/25</time></a></li><!----><!--]--><!--[--><li class="news-extended-item" data-v-f68d5a33><a href="/cna/local/202601/202601292557516.html" class="news-extended-link" data-v-f68d5a33><span class="news-extended-title" data-v-f68d5a33>台東便當業者寒冬送暖　連12年送禮金給弱勢團體</span><time class="news-extended